      "title": "Note: Speed settings (ComfyUI-RDNA4-Accel)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Speed settings (ComfyUI-RDNA4-Accel)\n\nTwo nodes between the loaders and the sampler:\n\n- **Unpinned Offload (fast model swap)** on MODEL and CLIP: the 15 GB text encoder and the 20 GB image DiT do not fit in 32 GB together, so every prompt change swaps them. Without page-locking the offloaded weights the swap is ~9 s faster. Same pixels.\n- **Text Encoder BF16**: the text encoder runs in bf16 instead of fp32 (~3 s faster here). Same composition, small differences in detail.\n\nMeasured, 1088x1920, 8 steps, prompt change: **28.3 s → 16.1 s**. Same prompt, new seed: ~6 s either way.\nSwitch either node off (enabled = false) to get the original behaviour back."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Speed settings (ComfyUI-RDNA4-Accel)\n\nTwo nodes between the loaders and the sampler:\n\n- **Unpinned Offload (fast model swap)** on MODEL and CLIP: the 15 GB text encoder and the 20 GB image DiT do not fit in 32 GB together, so every prompt change swaps them. Without page-locking the offloaded weights the swap is ~9 s faster. Same pixels.\n- **Text Encoder BF16**: the text encoder runs in bf16 instead of fp32 (~3 s faster here). Same composition, small differences in detail.\n\nMeasured, 1088x1920, 8 steps, prompt change: **28.3 s → 16.1 s**. Same prompt, new seed: ~6 s either way.\nSwitch either node off (enabled = false) to get the original behaviour back."
      },
